<title>ITALY: Benetton, Spain's Inditex mull cooperation.</title>
<headline>Benetton, Spain's Inditex mull cooperation.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian clothing group Benetton said in a statement it signed a letter of intent with Spanish apparel group Inditex for possible cooperation between the two groups.</p>
<p>The object was to create a joint venture that would allow the distribution in Italy of clothing for men, women and children under Inditex's Zara label.</p>
<p>It said Inditex was present in 10 European countries, with 550 outlets and a consolidated turnover of around 2.0 trillion lire.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
